  "text": "The Cupcake Hat is a Freestyle Jobs, head slot, clothing item that can be acquired in three different ways during the annual Birthday Bash event. The first method is via quest, the second is through the Coin Shop, and the third is from the Gifting Piñata.\n\nQuest Version\nthumb|Cupcake Hat (Quest)\n\nThe quest version of the Cupcake Hat is acquired by completion of the quest Perfecting the Batter,Freerealms: Birthday Bash: Origin Of Cakenstein on YouTube available during the Birthday Bash event. It is a blue-text item that comes in one color.\n\nSimilar to the Coin Shop version, it is a members only, nontradable clothing item.\n\nCoin Shop Version\nthumb|Cupcake Hat (Coin Shop)\n\nThe Coin Shop version of the Cupcake Hat is available during the Birthday Bash event exclusively to Members through the Coin Shop at the price of .buy it on YouTube It comes in three different color variations.\n\nSimilar to the quest version, it is a members only, nontradable clothing item.\n\nGifting Piñata Version\nthumb|Cupcake Hat (Gifting Piñata)\n\nThe Gifting Piñata version of the Cupcake Hat is acquired from the Gifting Piñata and through trade. The Gifting Piñata was available during 2011 Birthday Bash, but can no longer be acquired.\n\nUnlike the quest and Coin Shop versions, this version of the Cupcake Hat can be worn by non-members, traded to other players, and comes in a variety of different colors.\n\nGallery\n\nReferences\n\nCategory:Clothing\nCategory:Head\nCategory:Coin Shop\nCategory:Marketplace Items\nCategory:Coin Shop Clothing\nCategory:Birthday Bash\nCategory:Seasonal"
